OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be bright with sunny
OL,6,Fspells and just a few isolated light
OL,7,Fshowers over northern counties in the
OL,8,Fmorning, becoming dry in the afternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FDry at first with some bright
OL,11,Fspells but becoming cloudy through the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with some patchy
OL,13,Flight rain and freshening southerly
OL,14,Fwinds.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FCloudy but mostly dry morning,
OL,17,Fsome showery rain spreads east in the
OL,18,Fafternoon and evening. Strong
OL,19,Fsoutherly winds with a chance of
OL,20,Fcoastal gales, winds easing somewhat
OL,21,Fin the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
