OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,6,Fstart Monday then occasionally heavy
OL,7,Frain or showers and becoming windy.
OL,8,FWindy Tuesday with further
OL,9,Foccasionally heavy rain or showers.
OL,10,FMostly dry with bright spells on
OL,11,FWednesday.
